---
description: Quality gates for plugins in the smart-aiagent-plugins marketplace.
alwaysApply: false
globs:
  - "plugins/**"
  - "meta/**"
  - ".marketplace/**"
---

Before merging a new or updated plugin:

1. `plugin.manifest.json` exists and lists accurate `components` paths
2. Every path in `components` exists on disk (or is intentionally omitted)
3. Platform manifests reference the same paths — no duplicated skill/agent bodies
4. Marketplace entry added to `.marketplace/marketplace.json`
5. `npm run validate` passes
6. No secrets in `.mcp.json`, hooks, or commands
